{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：13:00 2026-11-25 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏大手筆送禮姊妹關係破冰  莊思華孖胞妹莊思明收LV手鏈  興奮狂叫相擁泯恩仇\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac145a6d9f3396b57e7bb9c568483dcb/2026-11/KF_0_48.jpg\"/>\n<p>莊思敏與雙胞胎細妹莊思華（Mona）及莊思明（Lisa）的82歲拿督夫人母親於今年8月離世，當時身為大女的莊思敏卻因在交平台曝光母親喪禮的短片，又在TVB節目《玄戰》通靈想聽亡母遺言，引起細妹莊思華不滿，直斥家姐「消費媽咪」，傳出姊妹不和。莊思敏前日（23日）在IG分享影片，見到胞妹莊思華及莊思明出鏡，關係似乎已破冰。</p>\n<h2>莊思敏海量禮物贈兩妹妹</h2>\n<p>莊思敏前日在IG上載一條新影片表示：「早點送出的聖誕禮物 #姊妹手鏈 #購物同時做善事，希望你哋中（鍾）意」。片中見到大家姐莊思敏先拿出BIGBANG演唱會的周邊服飾，包括黑Tee及手鏈，已令莊思華和莊思明好驚喜，兩位妹妹一邊開箱一邊大笑，表現得相當興奮，氣氛極其融洽。</p>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏早前作客節目《玄戰》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ff6b00078f0380cd3c704fc97cca9bfd/2026-09/14_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏將家事搬上節目分享。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9f71e0b3a06ea82ca35c97e8eddfed84/2026-09/15_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏以「2002年收到已故母親送的禮物及背後原因」作為考題。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fdc9f735c6cc29d551f38dd06ea4b7cc/2026-09/23_0_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏其後通靈感應亡母遺願。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e46269af38b478cb3c26d0adedfa606/2026-09/26_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏聞亡母「心底話」落淚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7f7c45bae3a723f8bcb8da37c42f8c5f/2026-09/33_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Angel隨即轉述莊媽媽的道歉與遺言，稱母親深知莊思敏多年來因環境所逼而身兼重任、貼心照顧弟妹十分辛勞，但亦深感抱歉仍需將照顧弟弟的重擔交託予她。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bb031bc3c4c544b22dcc5e72318e5ee9/2026-09/34_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"身為長女的莊思敏聽畢長久壓抑的情緒瞬間決堤，邊落淚邊力讚Angel轉述「好準確」，親口證實母親生前確實最放不下弟弟。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/00eca9a54f66660ad3b00df089dcbdf9/2026-09/35_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思華曾指責胞姐莊思敏「消費媽咪」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be4edb1eb627bc3ac34092744d10b7c5/2026-09/Jacquelin_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思華與家姐莊思敏冇隔夜仇，昨日（24日）在IG曝光聯同細妹莊思明為友人慶祝生日的合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/21edd0767ea8c44405156c793ee3e178/2026-11/6826_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏與胞妹莊思華關係破冰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/db5b0b3fe7e38bb5a984f36b595f51c2/2026-11/tvb_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思華（右）與莊思明收到家姐提早送聖誕禮物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e40e91658e99dac74509d122030d384d/2026-11/Mona_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏豪送多份禮物予胞妹莊思華及莊思明。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b30c103d0ed14e1da939af8de777d7e3/2026-11/Mona_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏向莊思華及莊思明送上BIGBANG演唱會Tee。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f7df0b697c23c852282da1ce8938c35b/2026-11/Mona_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏又送BIGBANG演唱會周邊飾物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0df5a3442cce8f016a1c9dc4cc46671a/2026-11/Mona_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏仲有準備LV禮物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e370a886e361fa7300106506c83ec03/2026-11/Mona_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思華與莊思明見到LV手鏈時興奮狂叫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7875c2dde9211ad7434434c4784234f9/2026-11/Mona_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏晒出送莊思華、莊思明手鏈，是姊妹同款。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/111297d7c31c0793253a002f0a5126bf/2026-11/Mona_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏（中）送極仲有。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6bc466f81c0fedb18de43d96a4033a2d/2026-11/Mona_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"當莊思華仍拆緊禮物時，雙胞胎妹妹莊思明已展示頸鏈以其名字「Lisa」設計。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1414f13a9dae0ef3a5ebf754c718a3dc/2026-11/Mona_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思華的頸鏈就以其名字「Mona」設計，可見莊思敏的心思。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/00d092a500d74fe80232fcc99ab08a54/2026-11/Mona_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏抱抱妹妹莊思華及莊思明，修復關係。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/250181c086ac99eb7f0b5388787b5ce5/2026-11/Mona_19_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏與細妹莊思華（右）在8月初莊思明的婚禮上，關係似乎未變惡劣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e9704d86175772c2396791c07d51b30a/2026-09/MONA.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思華疑寸家姐借喪事炒作，發文暗諷莊思敏「最少陪伴，說最多話」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6ad90f1c5d53ca3b6d0db0020a4e6ccd/2026-07/178540315441508.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏早前捲入疑藉喪母炒作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/67018d53ffa48912ab8ccf6709d05b0d/2026-09/Jacquelin_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏在IG限時動態有感而發。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cd3cdd1ef2ce62bd34e3a8b97022c2ca/2026-09/Jacquelin_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏在IG限時動態連發多個帖文。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb70d822ce4fc8bab086a515fe80b888/2026-09/Jacquelin_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏在IG限時動態表示：「有些關係，只要你決定『我不要了』。」疑有所指。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ccdef51e1612128e92a505fc3058ad7b/2026-09/Jacquelin_3_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>莊思敏提早送聖誕驚喜</h2>\n<p>之後莊思敏再拎出三包標誌性橙色Louis Vuitton（LV）禮物袋，妹妹莊思華與莊思明見狀即時雙眼發光，忍不住興奮得高聲尖叫，大呼是重點聖誕禮物。莊思敏又向二人展示手鏈，透露是姊妹同款飾物，而且是與聯合國兒童基金會（UNICEF）的合作系列。</p>\n<h2>莊思敏精心準備訂造禮物</h2>\n<p>其後莊思敏再拎出最後一份訂造的禮物，莊思華感謝家姐「破費喇」，與莊思明一齊打開首飾盒後，驚喜發現是一條極具設計感，又刻有二人各自英文名字「Mona」和「Lisa」的專屬手鏈。莊思明連聲道謝：「咁多禮物嘅，多謝家姐！」莊思敏更從後方緊緊抱住兩位妹妹，三姊妹頭貼頭對着鏡頭展現笑容，相信早前的隔閡已一掃而空。</p>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏亡母靈堂照曝光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3868611d1fff34110272c8e3a93b9d54/2026-09/001_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江玉珠與江道海是親姊弟。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a83c43ee7f4909f3998e98587a7eca66/2026-09/012.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"江道海是香港資深的電影導演與動作指導，曾為多部經典港片擔任動作或賭術指導。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d07e1e9eb38bd5f0413d656c73a16efa/2026-09/013.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊母離世前見證細女莊思明出嫁。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb59e215e060a4a75780c35eedf7eb88/2026-09/Jacquelin_6_.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思明與老公楊明向母親江玉珠敬茶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3e8993d725bd884d04049f66ea91193e/2026-09/Jacquelin_7_.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏、莊思明（Lisa）和莊思華（Mona）的父親莊寶是馬來西亞拿督。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a53195e96054f161f9699592013cf5ce/2024-02/jacquelinchng_14.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思敏、莊思明（Lisa）和莊思華（Mona）的父親莊寶（右二）是馬來西亞拿督。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf59f06fc399f05f699a2bfb36b79b5c/2024-02/jacquelinchng_15.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊父生前與太太有影皆雙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1731697da1f681d5ca1e93fa9b0d53db/2024-02/jacquelinchng_16.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊父生前與太太有影皆雙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e6113065a2af8202858fc3db6a69e0b7/2024-02/jacquelinchng_17.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊父與太太育有三女一子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b9845e611a57246962baa858b3b4f694/2024-02/jacquelinchng_18.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊父與太太育有三女一子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0bcd3ead33c999265860fd8a3da431f0/2024-02/jacquelinchng_19.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊父疼錫孫兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7f3f80d1a94375dc2c3831a913f77ca8/2024-02/jacquelinchng_20.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊父弄孫為樂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6c7448a529739785e14f90de0fb79b32/2024-02/jacquelinchng_21.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊父三代同堂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a797fb3c7a8d0a879f87f3482016e83c/2024-02/jacquelinchng_22.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊家人丁興旺。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4db2c45e17e2a6e36dc374502bc7b34f/2024-02/jacquelinchng_23.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊明（左）與莊父關係密切。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8883e466b89e2fa12e04e5a3bca72ab1/2024-02/jacquelinchng_24.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊明（右二）與莊思明拍拖多年，似乎早已獲莊父認可。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/84af2461b7e967569d971a3572d05922/2024-02/jacquelinchng_25.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"楊明（後左）早已融入莊家之中。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/57c943bf246fdfd8ed72f8860840de77/2024-02/jacquelinchng_26A.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思明曾公開父親莊寶年輕時的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ca1817801491802985291ac616b7558d/2024-02/jacquelinchng_11.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思明分享爸爸的舊照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6a9c4721b638c1cb078a1996f32d3da3/2024-02/jacquelinchng_12.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊思明的拿督父親年輕時期。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aad9a7124861e6438986439ab757d315/2024-02/jacquelinchng_13.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T05:23:54.399837+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":634,"images":49,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T05:00:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T05:17:19.295412+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T05:17:19.295412+00:00","content_hash":"0a1de6b65a4386a0321c0e1154a85f2976c20335384e8ce2868e9e186fdf3baa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}